# A run directory is output, never input. `mqt-scpd plan -o artifacts/<chip>`
# writes everything below, and re-running the stages reproduces all of it, so
# none of it belongs in the repository. The 69-qubit capacity plan alone is
# seven megabytes.
#
# This file lives here rather than in the root `.gitignore`, which an external
# template owns.

# Stage artifacts
*.fb

# Renderings of a stage or of the plain layout
*.svg
*.gds
*.gds2
*.oas

# What `plan` copies in beside them: the chip input and the configuration the
# run was made from
00-chip.json
config.toml
